<view class="page"><view class="title">人物设定</view><fields schema="{{schema}}" values="{{form}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:edit="edit" /><button bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存人物</button>
<view class="card"><view>试聊（不会加入正式消息）</view><input value="{{previewText}}" data-field="previewText" bindinput="input" placeholder="想问对方什么" /><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy}}">试聊</button><view class="plain">{{previewReply}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{person}}"><button bindtap="chat">开始聊天</button><view class="card" wx:if="{{relationship}}"><view>熟悉度：{{relationship.familiarityScore}}</view><view>亲近度：{{relationship.closenessScore}}</view><view>{{relationship.explanation}}</view><view wx:for="{{relationship.importantEvents}}" wx:key="*this">{{item.title || item}}</view></view><button bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}" class="danger">删除人物</button></view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="note">{{notice}}</view></view>
